        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s774",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · If there's one supplement James Bond wou",
            "text": "If there's one supplement James Bond would never skip, it's this one. Kino Mojo is a 7-ingredient testosterone optimization formula built with clinical doses of Tongkat Ali, Boron, Forskohlii, Zinc, Magnesium, Vitamin D3, and K2. Each ingredient targets a specific pathway in testosterone production, working together to raise both total and free testosterone, drive down estrogen, and create the hormonal environment of a man operating at his absolute peak.<br> <br>",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s777",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The results speak for themselves. Custom",
            "text": "The results speak for themselves. Customers consistently report 200+ point increases in total testosterone, and for many, the results go well beyond that, with free testosterone climbing sharply over the first 2-3 months. Higher free T means faster fat loss, leaner muscle, sharper focus, stronger lifts, and the kind of quiet confidence that shows up in every area of your life, from the boardroom to the bedroom.<br> <br>",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s780",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Three capsules a day with your first mea",
            "text": "Three capsules a day with your first meal. That's it. Most guys start feeling the difference within the first week. By months two and three, the effects are undeniable. This is the single most important supplement I recommend to any man who's serious about his physique, his drive, and the way he shows up in the world.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s782",
            "repere": "Titre H2 · FAQs",
            "text": "FAQs",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s785",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · What does Kino Mojo do? Kino Mojo is for",
            "text": "<strong>What does Kino Mojo do?</strong><br> Kino Mojo is formulated to support free testosterone levels, enhance body composition (lean muscle and less fat), and boost drive, ambition, and vitality.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s788",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Who should use Kino Mojo and when? It’s ",
            "text": "<strong>Who should use Kino Mojo and when?</strong><br> It’s designed for adult men wanting natural hormone support — especially those who want to improve energy, performance, and body composition as they age.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s791",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Are there any stimulants in Kino Mojo? T",
            "text": "<strong>Are there any stimulants in Kino Mojo?</strong><br> The primary focus is on nutrients and herbal extracts rather than stimulants, so it supports hormonal function without caffeine or harsh energy spikes.",
